# The sheets and lists over a book and the library that the other scripts don't open, on
# the test books (tools/e2e.zig plays it). Start from a fresh test folder: noface on its
# library. After each screen opens, `still` waits for it to show: noface drops a touch
# that lands before.

# A book's series, from holding it in the library: the list of series to put it in
hold library.hero 700
log screen: Sheet opened
drawn 300
still
tap card.3.2
log screen: Choices opened
drawn 300
shot series

# Back to the library along its top: the list, the series and the book's actions all
# done before the library is shown again. It's shown whole, with a refresh the panel
# takes a while over after the screen's memory is still, and a tap before it's done
# is dropped as meant for the list
tap goto.close
log screen: Sheet done
drawn 300
still
wait 1000

# Opening the book
tap library.hero
log screen: Reader opened
drawn 600
still

# Go To: its contents, its notes, and a chapter, which jumps there
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.goto
log screen: GoTo opened
drawn 300
shot goto
tap goto.tab.notes
drawn 200
still
tap goto.tab.contents
drawn 200
still
tap goto.row.1
log screen: GoTo done
drawn 500
still

# The chapter skips, on and back
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.chapter_next
drawn 500
still
tap toolbar.chapter_prev
drawn 500
still
tap toolbar.close
drawn 200
still

# Searching the book: typed, searched, and its first result, which jumps there
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.search
log screen: Search opened
drawn 300
still
tap key.g
drawn 200
tap key.a
drawn 200
tap key.r
drawn 200
tap key.d
drawn 200
tap key.e
drawn 200
tap key.n
drawn 200
tap key.search
log search:
drawn 500
shot search
tap goto.row.0
log screen: Search done
drawn 500
still

# The ⋮ menu: back to the beginning
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.more
log screen: More opened
drawn 300
shot more
tap more.beginning
log screen: More done
drawn 500
still

# The ⋮ menu's Go to page: a page typed in
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.more
log screen: More opened
drawn 300
still
tap more.go_to_page
log screen: PageEntry opened
drawn 300
still
tap key.3
drawn 200
tap key.search
log screen: PageEntry done
drawn 500
still

# Aa: each tab, Compact and back to Standard, and switches flipped and back
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.text
drawn 300
still
# It opens on Font, the tab it keeps
tap aa.switch.bold
drawn 600
still
tap aa.switch.bold
drawn 600
still
tap aa.tab.layout
drawn 200
still
tap aa.tab.more
drawn 200
shot aa-more
tap aa.switch.time_left
drawn 300
still
tap aa.switch.time_left
drawn 300
still
tap aa.tab.themes
drawn 200
still
# Each lays the book out again and refreshes the whole page, which the panel takes a
# while over, so these have more time
tap aa.theme.0
drawn 1500
still
tap aa.theme.1
drawn 1500
still
# Closed by a tap on the page under the sheet
tap aa.close
drawn 300
still

# Home: the library is back
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.home
log screen: Reader done
drawn 300
shot library
